  "basis": "Alice holds the leaf_heap anchor for the whole group: she lands on her back on the 0.5 m heap (root y = 0.5, the heap's top face) with her head toward the root curtain on the chamber's north side, looks up into the black at t=1.0 and is on her feet on the same heap at t=2.2, facing down the passage (-X). The White Rabbit runs his root_tunnel -> brick_mid line inside the group: he is already past the leaf heap at t=0, hurries away down the earth stretch on four legs with the gloves in his mouth, and stops and sits back on his haunches in the middle of the brick-vaulted passage at t=9.3 to read the watch, holding that spot through sh029. He is staged as kind=creature - a quadruped body on four legs with the head carried forward - per the H3S ruling that he is a real small animal and never an upright figure with hands.",
