  "warnings": [
    "sh027/sh028 keep camera.json's 1.30 m lens height - Alice's own eye-line - but a 0.30 m animal on the floor at 1.94 m cannot be held in a level frame from that height, so the optical axis tilts about 21-28 degrees down. The height, the lens and the axis down the passage are unchanged; only the declared 'level' angle gives way to the geometry.",
    "sh027: the Rabbit reads about 0.05 of frame height at the top of the shot instead of composition's 0.09, because his blocking_map start (root_tunnel) is 6.8 m from the leaf heap and a 28 mm lens cannot make him larger from there without moving him off his anchor.",
    "sh026's pedestal is a pure vertical 0.60 -> 1.30 m with 1.4 s held before and 2.0 s held after; the optical axis never changes.",
    "sh027's lens is moved back to 2.9 m from the leaf heap (still inside the 6.75 m chamber) so Alice reads as a near-edge silhouette rather than filling the frame, and the Rabbit is actually visible down the passage.",
    "PROP-pocket-watch is staged braced at his chest so sh029 has the dial it inserts on.",
    "sh029's lens is backed off to 0.50 m so the braced watch and his chest both read; at the 0.25 m a 0.05 m dial at 0.42 of frame height would need, the whitebox body fills the frame and the prop is invisible."
  ],
